WEBVTT

00:01:29.132 --> 00:01:32.990
Shenzhen didn't even exist as a city.

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:36.269
There were hardly any cars.

00:01:36.269 --> 00:01:38.920
Thirty years later,

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.915
this is Beijing today.

00:01:41.915 --> 00:01:43.628
This is Hong Kong.

00:01:43.628 --> 00:01:46.128
If you're wealthy, you live there,

00:01:46.128 --> 00:01:48.548
if you're poor, you live there,

00:01:48.548 --> 00:01:51.214
but high density it is, and it's not just Asia.

00:01:51.214 --> 00:01:53.171
São Paulo, you can travel

00:01:53.171 --> 00:01:55.695
in a helicopter 45 minutes

00:01:55.695 --> 00:01:57.705
seeing those high-rise buildings consume

00:01:57.705 --> 00:02:00.341
the 19th-century low-rise environment.